countless souls to the seas.

4
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,680
You want my treasure?

5
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:15,040
You can have it!

6
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:17,680
I left everything in one place.

7
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:19,940
Now you just have to find it!

8
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:21,867
Then, thus, a new age began.

9
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:25,380
This is the time known
as the Great Pirate Era!

10
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:29,560
Oh, I'm done playing
through with the waiting.

11
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:31,397
Either way, I'm feeling alive.

12
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:32,820
Look out below.

13
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:35,220
Wake up, sunshine.

14
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:37,100
Here we go.

15
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:40,480
Raise your flag up high.

16
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:42,900
Hail a brand new dawn.

17
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:45,955
Blaze across the sky.

18
00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:47,920
Time to journey on.

19
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:49,380
On your mark.

20
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:51,260
Come above the king.

21
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:54,037
We're on Earth, a legendary. Hooray.

22
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:55,997
If you can show your breath?

23
00:00:56,080 --> 00:00:57,668
Then we'll make some waves.

24
00:00:58,880 --> 00:01:00,397
We run our daunted!

25
00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:01,617
Ain't no beginners.

26
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:02,997
Cause if you're wanted!

27
00:01:03,080 --> 00:01:04,357
Then you're a winner.

28
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:06,837
For we are on the cruise.

29
00:01:06,920 --> 00:01:09,860
And freedom is the only rule.

30
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:12,277
Fearless night and day!

31
00:01:12,360 --> 00:01:14,120
Cause that's just our way.

32
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:17,197
Find one piece.

33
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:18,557
I'll be the first.

34
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:19,817
I'll put it be so bad!

35
00:01:19,900 --> 00:01:20,730
I could burst.

36
00:01:20,813 --> 00:01:22,157
It's all this real.

37
00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:26,340
It must be cause my hand's on the wheel.

38
00:01:26,980 --> 00:01:29,417
I'm done playing, filled with the waiting.

39
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:33,220
In a world I'm feeling
alive, but I'll be loud.

40
00:01:33,740 --> 00:01:37,040
Wake up, sunshine, here we go!

41
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:40,520
We have come so far.

42
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:44,260
Gotta make it to the end!

43
00:01:44,940 --> 00:01:47,677
Whatever danger we find,
no one ever left behind.

44
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:50,940
I've always got your back, my friend.

45
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:55,457
Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward.

46
00:01:55,540 --> 00:01:59,077
Dreaming from the very
first day, I'd make my name.

47
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:03,120
And don't you know that
dream hasn't changed.

48
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:06,897
I'm done playing through,
it's a wave in the air.

49
00:02:06,980 --> 00:02:09,600
The world I'm feeling
alive, look out below.

50
00:02:10,620 --> 00:02:12,980
Wake up, sunshine.

51
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:17,140
Wake up, sunshine.

52
00:02:18,540 --> 00:02:20,837
Wake up, sunshine here?

53
00:02:20,920 --> 00:02:23,560
We go!

54
00:02:26,940 --> 00:02:28,380
We go!

55
00:02:32,420 --> 00:02:34,280
Looks like it's about to blow!

56
00:02:36,540 --> 00:02:38,420
Pull back, men!

57
00:02:39,140 --> 00:02:42,780
We'll live to plunder
another day! Yeah, roger!

58
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:45,020
You don't gotta ask me twice!

59
00:02:45,700 --> 00:02:48,440
Antelope, Baratsumi, draw the ship!

60
00:02:48,720 --> 00:02:50,060
Okay, Captain, sure!

61
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:54,600
And the second is my name, and these
long-lost bridges out it later!

62
00:02:56,440 --> 00:02:57,400
Oh, no!

63
00:02:58,220 --> 00:03:03,161
Luffy, I don't know how the Kraken works,
but order him to turn around and haul ass!

64
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:04,860
Hey, Sodomy!

65
00:03:05,580 --> 00:03:06,500
Wait a sec!

66
00:03:08,540 --> 00:03:11,100
He's hauling ass just fine all on his own!

67
00:03:11,380 --> 00:03:14,057
We're such a giant monster,
it's kind of shameful, actually!

68
00:03:14,140 --> 00:03:14,970
Who cares?

69
00:03:15,260 --> 00:03:17,142
I would be doing the same thing.

70
00:03:19,420 --> 00:03:20,900
