71
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:22,280
Give him a break.

72
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:26,420
I'd rather be clumsy and alive
than graceful and dead. Come on.

73
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,678
I want to see lava.

74
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:30,920
