75
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,797
That's not going to help.

76
00:03:32,880 --> 00:03:34,468
It's just a couple of feet.

77
00:03:54,100 --> 00:03:55,757
Well, you've got your lava, Luffy.

78
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:57,016
It's getting hotter.

79
