be boiled alive down here.

80
00:04:01,460 --> 00:04:03,040
The ocean sure hates us.

81
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:09,160
Is this a fly?

82
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:10,654
Is this a good or bad?

83
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:16,757
Faster You can do it.

84
00:04:16,840 --> 00:04:18,237
The temperature change.

85
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:20,157
It's causing a vortex in the current.

86
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:21,317
Nami?

87
00:04:21,400 --> 00:04:23,537
Which direction is Fishman Island?

88
00:04:23,620 --> 00:04:25,337
We can't lose our way.

89
00:04:25,420 --> 00:04:27,377
You're not ready for real world yet.

90
00:04:27,460 --> 00:04:28,577
Straight ahead.

91
00:04:28,660 --> 00:04:29,880
