92
00:04:31,900 --> 00:04:33,480
We're getting closer.

93
00:04:37,300 --> 00:04:39,400
Now jump into the trench.

94
00:04:53,140 --> 00:04:54,920
That's not a place you jump!

95
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:56,240
It's an abyss!

96
00:04:57,060 --> 00:04:57,890
No!

97
00:04:57,973 --> 00:04:59,777
There's something to blackness down there!

98
00:04:59,860 --> 00:05:01,540
Fish people live there!

99
00:05:01,820 --> 00:05:03,420
It's gotta be insane!

100
00:05:09,740 --> 00:05:10,570
Lava!

101
00:05:10,653 --> 00:05:11,980
There's lava behind us!

102
00:05:12,100 --> 00:05:14,460
And the void in front of us! Help!

103
00:05:15,140 --> 00:05:16,857
Can't we go up? Up?

104
00:05:16,940 --> 00:05:19,937
Where's that burning and dark
and everything wants to kill us?

105
00:05:20,020 --> 00:05:22,217
Wait, you're being really gloomy, are you?

106
00:05:22,300 --> 00:05:23,957
You're some evil demon who looks like him

107
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:26,517
and wants to drag us
to the depths of hell!

108
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:27,776
This is a nightmare!

109
00:05:27,980 --> 00:05:29,156
Why can't I wake up?

110
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:30,310
Zootaman!

111
00:05:30,393 --> 00:05:31,223
Jump in!

112
00:05:40,660 --> 00:05:42,140
It's erupting again!

113
