Look above us!

114
00:05:44,020 --> 00:05:45,432
Something's coming down!

115
00:05:46,300 --> 00:05:47,130
Baldur's?

116
00:05:47,213 --> 00:05:48,043
A mudslide?

117
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:50,240
It's an avalanche! Brace yourself!

118
00:05:50,340 --> 00:05:52,077
The eruption knocked the rocks loose!

119
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:55,101
If one of those hits us,
then the sun is done for!

120
00:05:55,380 --> 00:05:57,086
Judge the Baldur's, so do me!

121
00:05:57,340 --> 00:05:58,477
I can't just sit here.

122
00:05:58,560 --> 00:05:59,717
I'm going to go cut them.

123
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:01,940
Luffy, hold onto my leg, okay?

124
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,420
Sure, gotcha!

125
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:05,860
Zara, you can't!

126
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:07,917
What's the big idea?

127
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:10,240
Yeah, let him go, Robin!

128
00:06:10,620 --> 00:06:13,267
The ship is over 8,000
meters deep right now!

129
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:14,577
Never mind the boulders!

130
00:06:14,660 --> 00:06:16,857
