pressure will crush you!

131
00:06:16,940 --> 00:06:18,697
Fine, but we gotta do something!

132
00:06:18,780 --> 00:06:21,480
Special Attack Green Star Sargasso!

133
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:31,440
Usa made seaweed appear!

134
00:06:33,260 --> 00:06:34,900
It stopped the boulders!

135
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:36,030
That's handy!

136
00:06:36,113 --> 00:06:38,040
Oh, wow! Nice shot!

137
00:06:38,140 --> 00:06:41,060
It won't hold for very long, though.

138
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:44,320
We gotta get moving, Tsurume! Move it!

139
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:56,140
Just in time!

140
00:07:01,500 --> 00:07:04,517
Monster plants? Oh, man! That's cool!

141
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:07,776
I wonder what else you have
in that big bag of tricks.

142
00:07:08,180 --> 00:07:09,945
Looks like we're in the clear!

143
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:14,040
You were pretty great
too, Sudamane! Sudamane!

144
00:07:15,380 --> 00:07:35,223
Sudamane!

145
00:07:40,100 --> 00:07:42,697
Aren't we alive or dead?

146
00:07:42,780 --> 00:07:47,277
There's light, but we're
so deep in the sea.

147
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:48,377
So bright!

148
00:07:48,460 --> 00:07:50,457
I've got stars in my eyes.

149
00:07:50,540 --> 00:07:53,497
Rather, just stars, they're in the eyes.

150
00:07:53,580 --> 00:07:57,477
Guys, check it out over there.

151
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:59,317
I think we made it.

152
00:07:59,400 --> 00:08:02,757
