It's huge!

159
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:23,297
It's in a giant bubble!

160
00:08:23,380 --> 00:08:25,540
It looks like they have clouds!

161
00:08:28,840 --> 00:08:32,957
All right, we made it!

162
00:08:33,040 --> 00:08:35,737
The New World is next!

163
00:08:35,820 --> 00:08:36,857
Almost there!

164
00:08:36,940 --> 00:08:38,197
Well, what do you know?

165
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:39,697
The moron survived!

166
00:08:39,780 --> 00:08:44,977
After all, this is
where the mermaids live!

167
00:08:45,060 --> 00:08:46,037
Real life!

168
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,517
Beautiful mermaids!

169
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:49,397
My dream can finally come true!

170
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:51,457
How I've longed to see their faces!

171
00:08:51,540 --> 00:08:53,100
To touch them!

172
