176
00:09:07,860 --> 00:09:08,820
I'm sorry.

177
00:09:09,100 --> 00:09:11,397
I thought my treatment would do the trick.

178
00:09:11,480 --> 00:09:14,657
I know it's your dream, but you're
not healthy enough for mermaids.

179
00:09:14,740 --> 00:09:15,570
Doctor!

180
00:09:15,653 --> 00:09:17,917
For him, this is a fate worse than death.

181
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:20,197
There's got to be something you can do!

182
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:22,517
If he sees mermaids, it will be death!

183
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:23,640
How cruel!

184
00:09:25,460 --> 00:09:27,020
I don't care.

185
00:09:27,620 --> 00:09:28,450
Saji!

186
00:09:28,680 --> 00:09:32,940
I don't want to live in
a world without dreams.

187
00:09:33,420 --> 00:09:36,420
I'd rather die there and
get some hot mermaid tail.

188
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:38,280
You're the worst!

189
00:09:38,780 --> 00:09:40,420
Who needs blood?

190
00:09:40,780 --> 00:09:43,740
