191
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:45,786
It's let your rebirth bright!

192
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:48,360
I'm so hungry.

193
00:09:48,740 --> 00:09:52,517
I bet they fry up all kinds of
yummy deep-sea monsters down here.

194
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:56,000
Hey, wipe up that drool
and tell City Mae to go.

195
