Oh, crap. That's not good.

198
00:10:13,560 --> 00:10:14,680
No bones!

199
00:10:14,920 --> 00:10:16,400
And now we're dead!

200
00:10:17,980 --> 00:10:19,980
Wow, they look tough!

201
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:22,080
I want one!

202
