Why would you allow these foolish
humors to tell you what to do? Crack in.

203
00:10:39,460 --> 00:10:41,280
What the heck, Tsutamae?

204
00:10:41,580 --> 00:10:43,840
Seriously, we were almost there!

205
00:10:58,280 --> 00:11:01,137
You guys are the straw
hat pirates aren't you?

206
00:11:01,220 --> 00:11:05,037
You have quite the
reputation for starters.

207
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:09,157
You were the ones who ruined
the Arlong pirate's plans.

208
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:13,480
That part makes sense at least.

209
00:11:14,560 --> 00:11:17,797
But for some reason two
years back when Hachi

210
00:11:17,880 --> 00:11:20,645
