up for your old enemy.

211
00:11:20,920 --> 00:11:25,240
And then you clocked one of the
celestial dragons right in his ugly face.

212
00:11:26,700 --> 00:11:29,660
Fisher tiger happened to
do the exact same thing,

213
00:11:29,860 --> 00:11:32,240
and he's the hero of this entire island.

214
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:35,320
Fisher tiger?

215
00:11:37,920 --> 00:11:40,060
I'm not sure what to do with you.

216
00:11:40,620 --> 00:11:41,973
Tell it to me straight.

217
00:11:42,100 --> 00:11:44,620
Are you supposed to be our enemies or not?

218
00:11:46,740 --> 00:11:50,197
How about I give you an
option enlist under our

219
00:11:50,280 --> 00:11:52,737
banner as members of
the new fishman pirates?

220
00:11:52,820 --> 00:11:57,040
Or else or else meaning
we sink you right now!

221
00:11:58,860 --> 00:12:03,997
What you say fuel up Franky hurry huh?

222
00:12:04,080 --> 00:12:05,037
