223
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:09,037
You and I both know that luffy isn't
going to cooperate with these guys!

224
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:13,097
But we're 10 000 meters underwater
right now and if we try to fight them

225
00:12:13,180 --> 00:12:16,017
we don't stand a chance of winning
especially not with those sea monsters!

226
00:12:16,100 --> 00:12:18,017
So we have to go!

227
00:12:18,100 --> 00:12:21,097
I need you to use all of the
oxygen we have to make a giant

228
00:12:21,180 --> 00:12:23,577
Kaido burst so we can charge
straight into fishman island!

229
00:12:23,660 --> 00:12:26,477
Whoa you kidding me?

230
00:12:26,560 --> 00:12:29,837
We've come way too far to die here!

231
00:12:29,920 --> 00:12:34,997
I agree it's risky but it's likely
our only chance at surviving this!

232
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:38,740
If that's the case I'm gonna
fill it up right away! Franky!

233
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:40,120
Steer the ship!

234
00:12:40,460 --> 00:12:42,540
Everything's gonna be just super!

235
00:12:44,660 --> 00:12:49,160
So, have you decided if you want to
be part of our crew, Straw Hat Luffy?

236
00:12:51,280 --> 00:12:53,660
Yeah, right, you wish! Stupid!

237
00:12:57,800 --> 00:12:59,960
Are you sure about that?

238
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:04,040
You did hear me say what will
happen if you refuse, didn't you?

239
00:13:04,340 --> 00:13:06,757
Guess you are the enemy of the fishmen.

240
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:09,297
Nothing but filthy human scum

241
00:13:09,380 --> 00:13:16,380
that's

242
00:13:16,780 --> 00:13:19,017
a real shame you won't be seeing

243
00:13:19,100 --> 00:13:22,577
Fish Man Island after all see Lion

244
00:13:22,660 --> 00:13:28,440
all right filled up and ready to move

245
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:38,840
Don't forget, we got our own life!

246
00:13:39,300 --> 00:13:41,888
Maybe we can fight some
other time, alright?

247
00:13:42,940 --> 00:13:44,217
Here goes...

248
00:13:44,300 --> 00:13:46,200
To the burn!

249
00:13:51,900 --> 00:13:53,280
Look at him go!

250
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:57,520
Can't breathe!

251
00:13:57,860 --> 00:13:59,340
There's no more air!

252
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:01,520
I'm getting squeezed!

253
00:14:02,580 --> 00:14:03,600
Hang on!

254
00:14:03,880 --> 00:14:05,640
We'll make it no matter what!

255
00:14:08,140 --> 00:14:09,760
What in the hell?

256
00:14:10,020 --> 00:14:12,040
What's up with that crazy ship?

257
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:13,800
We're on our way in!

258
00:14:14,220 --> 00:14:16,660
I'll be with you soon, beautiful mermaid!

259
00:14:23,420 --> 00:14:25,040
